Resolve native amd64 glibc libraries from a bounded system cache snapshot.

Preserve ELF ABI and cache metadata for exact SONAME lookup. Native glibc uses
RPATH/RUNPATH, its loader cache, then its compiled-in default directories;
non-native interpreters retain their existing interpreter/FHS fallback.
Root ownership, write-mode and size checks protect the cache provider.

Requires the following loader-library-runtime patch for metadata selection,
hwcaps extensions and the native loader diagnostic provider.

